body:
TrackingAction reattaches each dropped-ancestor SimVertex to its nearest stored ancestor, giving one connected SimTrack/SimVertex component per event. It is a general connectivity fix, detector-neutral and free in SIM CPU and output size, so it is on for every sample rather than gated by a process modifier.

@Moanwar asked me to make this PR for the summer production. Your decision to merge it or not if you think it might be useful to make the GEN-SIM of the production "truth graph"-ready, to be reprocessed later. 
It's not a back port of the full https://github.com/cms-sw/cmssw/pull/51562 , but only of the single line of code that fixes the broken simulation history. 

